{"title":"2022 SSMO Relay Round 5 Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_SSMO_Relay_Round_5_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/3/fd3c67c6710fa378ba458c6e0556276c8f340aed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T = TNYWR$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"117\" height=\"14\" />. Define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/a/33a28f69b8173b91f4328c13d2690e8cbb2fe451.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\operatorname{cis}(x) = \\cos(x) + i\\sin(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"198\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/f/b7fca3ded703bf29cf5409401c60be895fb9957d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_k=\\operatorname{cis}\\left(\\frac{k\\pi}{T+1}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"142\" height=\"45\" />. The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/d/a2d2202535839f82ec1cccbce08c6c61d15ae5de.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{k=1}^{T+1}\\frac{|a_{2k}+a_{2k+2}-a_{2k-1+T}|}{|a_{2k+1}-(a_{2k}+a_{2k+2})|}\\]\" width=\"213\" height=\"51\" /> can be expressed as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/2/c32d22fdf85b5a557c083f0b20142b57c5973013.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b\\cos(\\frac{\\pi}{c})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"34\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> are positive integers. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/b/6ebd1e0356cfe09c0d9b5459d6f1542657bb5891.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"72\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_SSMO_Relay_Round_5_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/c/bcc693785fcdb10c7aacabfb2a2e11c55c28a2a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\operatorname{cis}(x) = e^{ix}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"22\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/1/e0104010b71baa0d333bba6ab02892360cf1cc99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta=\\frac{\\pi}{T+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"84\" height=\"36\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/6/2466f5cfd6e2ce888e73be4ff2de5ecb43d215d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega=e^{i\\theta}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"17\" />, meaning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/7/407eec0d87f384d8deeece196b97d75db64f2d03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega^{T+1}=e^{\\pi i}=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"135\" height=\"19\" />. Each summand evaluates to \\begin{align*} \\frac{|a_{2k}+a_{2k+2}-a_{2k-1+T}|}{|a_{2k+1}-(a_{2k}+a_{2k+2})|} &amp;= \\frac{\\left|\\omega^{2k}+\\omega^{2k+2}-\\omega^{2k-1+T}\\right|}{\\left|\\omega^{2k+1}-\\omega^{2k}-\\omega^{2k+2}\\right|}\\\\ &amp;=\\frac{\\left|\\omega^{2k}\\right|\\left|1+\\omega^2+\\omega^{-2}\\right|}{\\left|\\omega^{2k}\\right|\\left|\\omega-1-\\omega^2\\right|}. \\end{align*} Now,  \\begin{align*} \\left|1+\\omega^{2}+\\omega^{-2}\\right|&amp;=\\left|1+\\left(\\cos(2\\theta)+i\\sin(2\\theta)\\right)+\\left(\\cos(-2\\theta)+i\\sin(-2\\theta)\\right)\\right|\\\\ &amp;=|1+2\\cos(2\\theta)|=1+2\\cos(2\\theta)\\\\ &amp;=1+2\\left(2\\cos^2(\\theta)-1\\right)=(2\\cos(\\theta)-1)(2\\cos(\\theta)+1) \\end{align*} and \\begin{align*} \\left|\\omega-1-\\omega^2\\right|^2&amp;=\\left(\\omega-1-\\omega^2\\right)\\overline{\\left(\\omega-1-\\omega^2\\right)}\\\\ &amp;=\\left(\\omega-1-\\omega^2\\right)\\left(\\frac{1}{\\omega}-1-\\frac{1}{\\omega^2}\\right)\\\\ &amp;=\\frac{\\left(\\omega^2-\\omega+1\\right)^2}{\\omega^2}\\implies\\\\ \\left|\\omega-1-\\omega^2\\right|&amp;=\\frac{\\omega^2-\\omega+1}{\\omega}=\\omega-1+\\frac{1}{\\omega}\\\\ &amp;=\\left(\\cos(\\theta)+i\\sin(\\theta)\\right)-1+\\left(\\cos(-\\theta)+i\\sin(-\\theta)\\right)\\\\ &amp;=2\\cos(\\theta)-1. \\end{align*} So, each summand evaluates to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/6/816337a827050458205aac367c116bc91ab0c085.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\left|1+\\omega^2+\\omega^{-2}\\right|}{\\left|\\omega-1-\\omega^2\\right|}=\\frac{(2\\cos(\\theta)-1)(2\\cos(\\theta)+1)}{2\\cos(\\theta)-1}=2\\cos(\\theta)+1.\\]\" width=\"472\" height=\"44\" /> So, the sum evaluates to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/4/924bf6f0c376148198087dcd9cbb62b043cead57.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(T+1)\\left(2\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{T+1}\\right)+1\\right)=32\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{16}\\right)+16\\implies 16+32+16=\\boxed{64}.\\]\" width=\"561\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>~pinkpig\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018022115\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 58/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2739/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26230:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018022115 and revision id 280208. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}